<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Plutonic sees good full year result.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Plutonic sees good full year result.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold miner Plutonic Resources Ltd said on Thursday it was on track for a good profit result for calendar 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;Given the stronger than expected profit result for the first half and the strengthening performance at the operations, the company is on track for a good 1996 profit result,&quot; Plutonic said in a statement accompanying its first half results.</p>
</text>
